---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy • Teer Result Live"
  description="Privacy Policy for Teer Result Live (teerresultlive.in)."
>
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-slate-700 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs">
    <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <p>
      At Teer Result Live (<a href="https://teerresultlive.in" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">teerresultlive.in</a>), the privacy of our visitors is of extreme importance to us. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of personal information that is received and collected by Teer Result Live and how it is used.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Log Files &amp; Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Like many other Web sites, Teer Result Live makes use of log files and privacy-focused analytics. The information inside the log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, type of browser, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamp, and referring/exit pages to analyze trends and administer the site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
    <p>
      Teer Result Live uses cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, record user-specific information on which pages the user access or visit, and customize Web page content based on visitors' browser type or other information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Google DoubleClick DART Cookie</h2>
    <p>
      Google, as a third party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on teerresultlive.in. Google's use of the DART cookie enables it to serve ads to users based on their visit to teerresultlive.in and other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of the use of the DART cookie by visiting the Google ad and content network privacy policy.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
